{'symbol': 'NXPI', 'date': '2022-11-14 03:00:00', 'title': 'NEW NXP ANALOG FRONT-END ENABLES THE SOFTWARE-DEFINED FACTORY', 'text': 'MUNICH, GERMANY, NOV. 14, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ELECTRONICA -- NXP SEMICONDUCTORS (NASDAQ: NXPI) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS NEW NXP ANALOG FRONT-END (N-AFE) FAMILY FOR HIGH-PRECISION DATA ACQUISITION AND CONDITION MONITORING SYSTEMS FOR FACTORY AUTOMATION. DESIGNED AS SOFTWARE-CONFIGURABLE UNIVERSAL ANALOG INPUT DEVICES, THE NEW N-AFE FAMILY HELPS ENABLE THE SOFTWARE-DEFINED FACTORY, MAKING IT EASIER FOR OPERATORS TO CONFIGURE A SMART FACTORY AND ADJUST SETTINGS BASED ON SHIFTING MARKET NEEDS.'}